    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/82e91e15121d58c18a860e4aa12797f1.webp?t=1667292829\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Challenging bow play -</h2> Easy to learn, extremely rewarding to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- A variety of enemies -</h2>Do your best to hold back the tide of mythical creatures, all posing different challenges to overcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.poster.avif?t=1667292829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.webm?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.mp4?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Control the pace of the battle -</h2>Need more of a challenge? Start the waves early for a high risk high reward play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Beautiful scenery -</h2>Breath in the fresh air of the nordic valley, the calming sounds of the ocean and the seaguls. Enjoy the silence before the storm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Customize your playthrough -</h2>Choose between powerful abilities as you progress, increasing your own lethality, but also that of your enemy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.poster.avif?t=1667292829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.webm?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.mp4?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Set in the idyllic viking village of Tyrgard, you are set to protect your people from an onslaught of vicious mythical creatures.<br><br>As a master archer, you unlock an array of unique skills and abilities, while advancing through waves of enemies.<br>But just as you, they too become more powerful as the battle progresses.<br><br>Get familiar with your bow and abilities to learn how to best prioritize threats.<br>The difficulty increases as you progress and you will encounter new types of enemies, who will challenge your mastery, reflex and awareness.<br>- You will not survive, so make it count.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/82e91e15121d58c18a860e4aa12797f1.webp?t=1667292829\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Challenging bow play -</h2> Easy to learn, extremely rewarding to master.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- A variety of enemies -</h2>Do your best to hold back the tide of mythical creatures, all posing different challenges to overcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.poster.avif?t=1667292829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.webm?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/8debdb81cb29b2b77ef35f5ef384d047.mp4?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Control the pace of the battle -</h2>Need more of a challenge? Start the waves early for a high risk high reward play.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Beautiful scenery -</h2>Breath in the fresh air of the nordic valley, the calming sounds of the ocean and the seaguls. Enjoy the silence before the storm.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Customize your playthrough -</h2>Choose between powerful abilities as you progress, increasing your own lethality, but also that of your enemy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.poster.avif?t=1667292829\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.webm?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1335440/extras/a65581cf644fd3d802d5d2664b0e9bf0.mp4?t=1667292829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Set in the idyllic viking village of Tyrgard, you are set to protect your people from an onslaught of vicious mythical creatures.<br><br>As a master archer, you unlock an array of unique skills and abilities, while advancing through waves of enemies.<br>But just as you, they too become more powerful as the battle progresses.<br><br>Get familiar with your bow and abilities to learn how to best prioritize threats.<br>The difficulty increases as you progress and you will encounter new types of enemies, who will challenge your mastery, reflex and awareness.<br>- You will not survive, so make it count.",
    "short_description": "Prepare yourself against the incoming hordes of unique enemies! Dodge flying spears, magical ravens and kamikaze dragons! Immerse yourself in a stylish low-poly environment. Upgrade your bow, improve your skill and become the champion Tyrgard needs you to be!",
